   own voice.
2. **The post-submit "thanks" branch** in
   `template-parts/reviews/standalone-review-page.php`, which still reads
   *"Thank you **—** your review has been sent."* Outside the brief
   (*"no other copy touched"*), so **not edited and not asserted**.
   ⛔ **RAISED, NOT RESOLVED: CYCLE179-LD-51.** One string, one word of
   Andrew's, and the same rail should reach it.

