| 5 | `template-parts/reviews/review-section.php:64` — **FOUND BY THE SWEEP, not in the brief** | `_n('%1$s out of 5 — from %2$s reader review', '…reader reviews')` | `_n('%1$s out of 5, from %2$s reader review', '…reader reviews')` |

⚠ **#5 needs Gandalf's eye on the wording.** A full stop does not work
mid-phrase, so the em dash became a **comma**. That is my choice, not approved
