- **`{SchoolName}` now reads the order's own `_bhp_school_visit_school`**
  (`BHP_SCHOOL_PICKUP_META_SCHOOL`, declared by the bundle plugin) **first**,
  registry second — in both `bhp_review_ask_school_name()` and
