4. Seal 1015 — touch-1 hero for `dallas-harris-2026-09-03` becomes frame **04**;
   crops 03/04/05 and their `-plain` twins ship; mapping stays filterable; day 0
   keeps frame 01.
5. The day-0 order/downloads tables reflow at 375px, or the downloads table is
